{"author":{"id":"bc879001b271aeebdd38a690df6011bef3fd316a5680eda2689f43e26c43d0a4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795215390,"nonce":"bCzM+ChcMqBgeteNGQMPZ+38mmI=","title":"List parameters match no rows in IN and UNWIND against values written by apply_delta","message":"At 64f41a2, a list query parameter never matches stored values that were written through `Connection::apply_delta`, while the same values match an equality parameter or a literal list.\n\nReproducer (found from hxn-assets' knowledge adapter, adapters/kyugraph):\n\n1. Create `CREATE NODE TABLE Npc (_hxn_key STRING, id STRING, PRIMARY KEY (_hxn_key))` and write one node through a `DeltaBatchBuilder` upsert with `_hxn_key = [\"campaign\",\"sage\"]` (a JSON string) and `id = sage`.\n2. Queries, with `keys = List([String(\"[\\\"campaign\\\",\\\"sage\\\"]\")])` and `ids = List([String(\"sage\")])` built with `TypedValue::from(serde_json::Value::Array(..))`:\n   - `MATCH (n:Npc) WHERE n._hxn_key = $k RETURN n._hxn_key` with a scalar string parameter: 1 row.\n   - `MATCH (n:Npc) WHERE n._hxn_key IN $keys RETURN n._hxn_key`: 0 rows.\n   - `UNWIND $keys AS wanted MATCH (n:Npc) WHERE n._hxn_key = wanted RETURN n._hxn_key`: 0 rows.\n   - `MATCH (n:Npc) WHERE n.id IN $ids RETURN n._hxn_key`: 0 rows.\n   - `UNWIND $ids AS wanted MATCH (n:Npc) WHERE n.id = wanted RETURN n._hxn_key`: 0 rows.\n   - `MATCH (n:Npc) WHERE n._hxn_key = $k0 OR n._hxn_key = $k1 RETURN n._hxn_key` with scalar parameters: 1 row.\n\nOn a table populated with `CREATE (t:T {k:'...'})` instead, `UNWIND $keys AS key MATCH (t:T) WHERE t.k = key` and a literal `IN ['...']` both return the row, while `IN $keys` still returns 0. So list parameters compare unequal to stored strings, at least for delta-written rows.\n\nAlso: `MATCH (n:Npc) UNWIND $keys AS wanted WITH n, wanted WHERE n._hxn_key = wanted RETURN n._hxn_key` fails with `Runtime(\"variable index 2 out of range\")`.\n\nhxn-assets works around it with OR-ed scalar parameters.","files":null}]}